                                                "text": "the Maltſter will ſtir his Barley Couches till the Sprit begins to fork , five or ſix times a day or more ; it being always his Care to keep them from drying too much on the outſides"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34b979d8-3233-45e9-bb14-851c4e6b9ec0",
                                                "sense_id": "dd0fe22b-3241-3ef8-bdb9-a227445c9237",
                                                "text": "The maltster, after having lain down in his clothes for a few hours, was now sitting beside a three-legged table, breakfasting off bread and bacon."
                                            }
